                DESIGN PATTERNS
                      |
        +-------------+-------------+
        |             |             |
   Creational     Structural    Behavioral
       5               7             11

       1. Creational Patterns — 5
       Object कैसे create करना है, यह बताते हैं।
       #
       Pattern
       आसान मतलब
       1 Singleton
       पूरी application में एक ही object

       Already implemented:

       Spring Beans — default scope Singleton and Runtime.getRuntime()
       Example: Logger, Database Connection, Thread Pool, Cache

       2 Factory Method
       Object creation को अलग method/class में रखना

       Already implemented:

       Calendar.getInstance()
       NumberFormat.getInstance()
       Spring BeanFactory

       Example: ShapeFactory, AnimalFactory, CarFactory

       3 Abstract Factory
       Related objects की family create करना
       Already implemented:

       Java DocumentBuilderFactory
       TransformerFactory
       JDBC-related factory APIs

       Example: GUIFactory, WidgetFactory, VehicleFactory

       4 Builder
       Complex object को step-by-step बनाना
       5 Prototype
       Existing object को clone करके नया object बनाना

       आपने अभी Singleton देखा है।

        Already implemented:

        Lombok @Builder
        StringBuilder
        HttpRequest.Builder
        Spring ResponseEntity builder methods

        Example: MealBuilder, HouseBuilder, CarBuilder
        but in code, we can use Lombok @Builder annotation to implement Builder pattern.

        5. Prototype
        cloning the objects.
        Already implemented:

        Java Cloneable
        Object.clone()
        Example: ShapePrototype, AnimalPrototype, CarPrototype

       2. Structural Patterns — 7

       Classes/objects को एक-दूसरे के साथ कैसे जोड़ना है, यह बताते हैं।

       #	Pattern	आसान मतलब
       1	Adapter	Incompatible interfaces को compatible बनाना
       Already implemented:

       InputStreamReader
       OutputStreamWriter
       Spring integration adapters
       Example: Java Collections Adapter classes, Spring MVC HandlerAdapter

       2	Bridge	Abstraction और implementation को अलग करना

       Example: JDBC API, Java AWT, Spring MVC
       Java में GUI/AWT जैसी APIs में abstraction/implementation separation के concepts मिलते हैं।

       3	Composite	Objects को tree structure में रखना
       Example: Java AWT, File System, XML DOM

       Already implemented:

       Java Swing/AWT component hierarchy
       File/directory tree concepts

       4	Decorator	Existing object में dynamically functionality जोड़ना
       Example: Java I/O Streams, Java Collections, Spring AOP
       Already implemented:

       Java I/O बहुत अच्छा example है:

       5	Facade	Complex system के लिए simple interface देना
         Example: Java JDBC, Java JNDI, Spring JdbcTemplate

         Already implemented:

         JdbcTemplate
         Spring RestTemplate
         Spring JdbcTemplate internally hides JDBC complexity

       6	Flyweight	Objects को share करके memory बचाना
       Example: Java String Pool, Java Integer Cache, Spring Bean Scopes
       Already implemented:

       Integer.valueOf()
       String pool
       Wrapper object caching

       7	Proxy	Original object के सामने controlling object रखना
       Example: Java RMI, Java Dynamic Proxy, Spring AOP
        Spring अक्सर proxy के माध्यम से transaction behavior apply करता है।

        Also:

        Spring AOP
        @Transactional
        @Cacheable
        @Async

        Proxy pattern से heavily related हैं।

       3. Behavioral Patterns — 11

       Objects आपस में कैसे communicate/behave करेंगे, यह बताते हैं।

       #	Pattern	आसान मतलब
       1	Chain of Responsibility	Request को handlers की chain में भेजना
       Example: Java Servlet Filter, Java Logging Framework, Spring Security Filter Chain
        Already implemented:

        Spring Security filter chain इसका excellent practical example है।

        Security Filter
              ↓
        Authentication
              ↓
        Authorization
              ↓
        Controller

       2	Command	Request को object के रूप में represent करना
       Example: Java Runnable, Java ActionListener, Spring @EventListener
       Already implemented:

       Runnable
       Swing Action
       Undo/redo systems

       3	Interpreter	Language/grammar को interpret करना
       Example: Java Regex, SQL Parser, Spring Expression Language (SpEL)
       Already implemented:

       Regular Expression engines
       Expression Language
       Spring Expression Language — SpEL

       4	Iterator	Collection को sequentially traverse करना
       Example: Java Iterator, Java Enumeration, Spring Data JPA PagingAndSortingRepository
       Already implemented:

       Java Collections:

       Iterator
       ListIterator

       5	Mediator	Objects के communication को centralize करना
       Example: Java AWT Event Dispatch Thread, Spring ApplicationEventPublisher

       Real-world example:

       Chat room:

       User → ChatRoom → Other Users

       Already implemented:

       GUI event systems में mediator-style communication मिलता है।

       6   Memento	Object की previous state save करना
       Example: Java Serializable, Java Cloneable, Spring Session
       Already implemented:

       Undo/Redo functionality
       Editor history systems

       7	Observer	एक object change हो तो dependents को notify करना
         Example: Java Observable, Java PropertyChangeListener, Spring ApplicationEventPublisher
         Example:

         Order Service
               |
               +---- Email Service
               |
               +---- SMS Service
               |
               +---- Notification Service

         Spring में:

         ApplicationEventPublisher
         @EventListener

         यह observer-style event mechanism provide करता है।

       8	State	Object का behavior state के अनुसार बदलना
       Example: Java Thread State, Java Swing Button Model, Spring State Machine

       Example:

       Order

       CREATED
          ↓
       PAID
          ↓
       SHIPPED
          ↓
       DELIVERED

       हर state में behavior अलग हो सकता है।

       Real-world:

       Order/payment/workflow systems में बहुत common।

       9	Strategy	Runtime पर algorithm/behavior बदलना
         Example: Java Comparator, Java Collections.sort(), Spring Security PasswordEncoder
         Already implemented:

         Comparator
         Spring's many pluggable implementations
         AuthenticationProvider style designs

       10	Template Method	Algorithm का skeleton define करना
         Example: Java AbstractList, Java AbstractMap, Spring JdbcTemplate
         Spring में बहुत important:

         JdbcTemplate
         RestTemplate

         इनमें template-style design का उपयोग किया गया है।

       11	Visitor	Existing classes बदले बिना operations add करना
            Example: Java AWT Visitor, Java DOM Visitor, Spring BeanPostProcessor
       याद रखने की Trick

       Example:

       Employee
          |
          +-- Developer
          +-- Manager

       Visitor:

       TaxVisitor
       SalaryVisitor
       ReportVisitor

       एक ही objects पर अलग-अलग operations perform कर सकते हैं।

       Already implemented:

       Java compiler/AST processing और कई tree-processing libraries में Visitor pattern मिलता है।
                       DESIGN PATTERNS
                             |
               +-------------+-------------+
               |             |             |
          Creational     Structural    Behavioral
              5               7             11
        S F A B P       A B C D F F P   C C I I M M O S S T V
       5 + 7 + 11 = 23

| Pattern              | याद रखने का Keyword |
| -------------------- | ------------------- |
| **S**ingleton        | एक Object           |
| **F**actory          | Object बनाना        |
| **A**bstract Factory | Factory की Factory  |
| **B**uilder          | Step-by-step बनाना  |
| **P**rototype        | Copy/Clone          |



| Letter | Pattern   | Keyword              |
| ------ | --------- | -------------------- |
| **A**  | Adapter   | Compatible बनाना     |
| **B**  | Bridge    | अलग करना             |
| **C**  | Composite | Tree/Group           |
| **D**  | Decorator | Functionality जोड़ना |
| **F**  | Facade    | Simple interface     |
| **F**  | Flyweight | Share/Memory         |
| **P**  | Proxy     | Control access       |



       | Letter | Pattern                 | Keyword            |
       | ------ | ----------------------- | ------------------ |
       | **C**  | Chain of Responsibility | Chain              |
       | **C**  | Command                 | Request/Object     |
       | **I**  | Interpreter             | Language           |
       | **I**  | Iterator                | Traverse           |
       | **M**  | Mediator                | Communication      |
       | **M**  | Memento                 | Previous State     |
       | **O**  | Observer                | Notification       |
       | **S**  | State                   | State बदलना        |
       | **S**  | Strategy                | Algorithm बदलना    |
       | **T**  | Template Method         | Algorithm skeleton |
       | **V**  | Visitor                 | New operation      |

